ind":"update","title":"Final Demo Update: New Choices and 4 New Languages! 🐜","summary":"The final update for the Ants Took the Kitchen demo brings more control over your colony and a much-requested community feature!Before taking the next step toward the full game, I’ve put together a few additions based on your feedback.🐜 Choose Your Starting AntsUntil now, every area started with Common Ants. Now, you can decide how your colony takes its first steps in each new area!Whenever more than one ant type is available, a new window will let you choose your starting ants from Common, Tita","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T01:22:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672873","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956610-1840944183784583","game_id":"steam-4956610","kind":"announcement","title":"🐜 New Ants Have Joined the Colony!","summary":"A new update for Ants Took the Kitchen Demo is now available!This one brings two brand-new ant types, four new languages, and a small but important fix to crumb spawning.💪 Meet the Titan!The Titan is built for the heavy stuff.Has 3x the strength of a Common AntMoves at half the speedPrioritizes larger crumbsIt may be slower, but when something heavy needs to move, the Titan is the ant for the job.⚡ Meet the Dash!The Dash is all about speed.Moves 2x faster than a Common AntHas half the strengthIt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T20:31:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183784583","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956610-1840944183772579","game_id":"steam-4956610","kind":"announcement","title":"Tutorials + Expedition Improvements","summary":"A new update for Ants Took the Kitchen Demo is now available!✍️ Tutorials are availableI know that a lot of people, just like me, don’t like tutorials in incremental games. But I’ve noticed in some YouTubers’ gameplay videos and received a few pieces of feedback that some players didn’t know how to proceed in certain parts, especially when a new mechanic is introduced.For this reason, I’ve added a brief explanation whenever new mechanics are introduced. For those who don’t like them, the tutoria","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-11T23:48:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183772579","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956610-1840310314348440","game_id":"steam-4956610","kind":"announcement","title":"Japanese & German + The Most Requested Feature!","summary":"A new update for Ants Took the Kitchen is now available!🌎 Japanese and German are now availableThe demo can now be played in two new languages:🇯🇵 Japanese🇩🇪 German🐜 Buy Max is here!The most requested feature since the demo launched has finally been added!You can now use the MAX(+N) button to purchase as many levels of an upgrade as you can afford at once. No more clicking the same upgrade over and over when you have a mountain of food to spend.🎮 Controller FixFixed an issue where the Upgrades pa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T00:30:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314348440","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956610-1840310314339868","game_id":"steam-4956610","kind":"update","title":"Update demo-1.2.1","summary":"A small hotfix is now available.Fixed an issue where the Prestige ability requirements for Golden Instinct and Queen’s Mandible were reversed.Thank you to everyone who reported the issue!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T17:46:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314339868","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4956610-1840310314339107","game_id":"steam-4956610","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Available Now!","summary":"A tiny colony has found its way into the kitchen—and it is ready to grow.Experience a relaxing incremental game about building momentum, discovering new possibilities, and watching your colony become more efficient with every step forward.Play the demo, share your feedback, and add the full game to your wishlist!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T12:52:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314339107","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4956610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:25Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:24Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4956610":"2026-10-26T05:34:25Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4956610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5011970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:25Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:34:25Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4956610","app_id":4956610,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:11Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"